    },
    {
      "id": "57cde9d5-567b-4d9f-ab51-b991e409acd6",
      "content": "English: Jordan | French: Jourdain | Latin: Iordan | Origin: &#1497;&#1463;&#1512;&#1456;&#1491;&#1468;&#1461;&#1503; -- &#921;&#959;&#961;&#948;&#945;&#957;&#951;&#962; | Vietnamese: Gio-đan -- sông lớn nhất ở Pa-lét-tin, G 40,23 ; Mt 3,5-6 ; Lc 3,3",
